.TH xml_free 3
.SH NAME
xml_free \- free an entire XML node tree
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "xml.h"
.PP
.BI "void xml_free(xmlnode *" node ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xml_free
recursively frees all nodes in the tree starting at
.IR node .
It handles memory cleanup for node names, attribute maps, and children lists.